    <item>
      <title>IFA 2026成中国科技欧洲年会：AI家电与新物种直接接受生意检验</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/IFA-2026%E6%88%90%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2%E5%B9%B4%E4%BC%9AAI%E5%AE%B6%E7%94%B5%E4%B8%8E%E6%96%B0%E7%89%A9%E7%A7%8D%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%94%9F%E6%84%8F%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C/</link>
